    "topic": "ne … pas wraps the verb",
    "rule": "Negation is a sandwich: ne goes BEFORE the conjugated verb, pas right AFTER it. Before a vowel, ne shrinks to n' (je n'ai pas). Write both halves, always — dropping 'ne' is spoken-only.",
